    Rationale:                                                                
                                                                                
    Mac name table entries are not needed anymore. Even Apple stopped           
    producing name tables with platform 1. Please see for example the           
    following system font:                                                      
                                                                                
    /System/Library/Fonts/SFCompact.ttf                                         
                                                                                
    Also, Dave Opstad, who developed Apple's TrueType specifications, told      
    Olli Meier a couple years ago (as of January/2022) that these entries are   
    outdated and should not be produced anymore.                                
                                                                                
    More info: https://github.com/googlefonts/gftools/issues/469

